          "para": "Once free, Mij turned the aircraft cabin into a circus ring. He bolted down the centre of the plane, streaking past rows of passengers, who leapt up in alarm; a passenger's food was spilt, there were shrieks of fright, and the distracted author chased his runaway otter down the aisle in mortification. Calm returned only through the air hostess, who was kind and cooperative when the wretched author apologised and appealed for help. She suggested that Mij might settle better on the author's knee, and helped him get the otter back under control. Exhausted by his adventure, Mij finally perched on Maxwell's knee, nuzzled the author's face and neck, and allowed himself to be petted until he was calm again. The episode is embarrassing, exciting and funny at once, and it shows how completely the little otter trusted his owner once he found him.",
